  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Virtual Consultation: Convenient Dental Care at Mason Park Dental of Katy",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Dentist Katy, TX",
   "section": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Seamless Dental Advice from the Comfort of HomeMason Park Dental of Katy invites you to our virtual consultation services, bridging the gap between your dental needs and busy schedule. Easily connect with our trusted dentists, Dr. William Sung, Dr. Dave Cho, and Dr. Tam Nguyen, for professional advice on services ranging from Invisalign to pediatric dental care, all without leaving your home.",
   "html": "<p>Seamless Dental Advice from the Comfort of Home<br><a href=\"/\">Mason Park Dental of Katy</a> invites you to our virtual consultation services, bridging the gap between your dental needs and busy schedule. Easily connect with our trusted dentists, Dr. William Sung, Dr. Dave Cho, and Dr. Tam Nguyen, for professional advice on services ranging from Invisalign to pediatric dental care, all without leaving your home.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 5,
   "text": "Quick and Easy Virtual Visits",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Fill out our form on the Virtual Consultation page.Upload images of your teeth if needed.Submit and await our call to schedule your online appointment.",
   "html": "<p>Fill out our form on the Virtual Consultation page.<br>Upload images of your teeth if needed.<br>Submit and await our call to schedule your online appointment.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 5,
   "text": "Get Started with Your Digital Dental Journey",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "For expert dental guidance at your fingertips, reach out to Mason Park Dental of Katy. Your journey to a perfect smile is just a click away. Visit us online or call +1 281-769-8878 to arrange your virtual consultation.",
   "html": "<p>For expert dental guidance at your fingertips, reach out to Mason Park Dental of Katy. Your journey to a perfect smile is just a click away. Visit us online or call +1 281-769-8878 to arrange your virtual consultation.</p>",
   "section": 4
  },
  {
